{"seq":4,"slug":"version-management-and-publishing","title":"版本管理与发布","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/version-management-and-publishing","wordCount":813,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"版本管理与发布\">版本管理与发布</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>版本管理是 npm 生态的契约层——它决定了依赖升级的语义、发布流程的自动化和废弃策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>SemVer 三段式</strong>：<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code> 分别对应破坏性变更、向下兼容的新功能、向下兼容的修复。</li>\n<li><strong>版本范围语法</strong>：<code>^</code> 允许 minor/patch 升级，<code>~</code> 只允许 patch；对 0.x 版本 <code>^</code> 行为更保守，因为 SemVer 规定 0.x 表示 API 不稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>发布流程</strong>：<code>npm publish</code> 配合 <code>prepublishOnly</code> 等钩子确保构建与测试通过；<code>dist-tag</code> 管理 latest/next 等发布通道。</li>\n<li><strong>规模化版本管理</strong>：Changesets 把版本变更记录为可评审的文件，在 CI 中批量计算版本号并生成 changelog。</li>\n<li><strong>废弃与撤回</strong>：<code>npm deprecate</code> 是推荐的软废弃方式，<code>unpublish</code> 有严格的时间窗口限制。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"语义化版本-semver\">语义化版本（SemVer）</h2><p>语义化版本是 npm 生态的版本管理基石。每个版本号由三部分组成：<code>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</code>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    V[&quot;2.4.1&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; MAJOR[&quot;2 - 主版本&lt;br/&gt;不兼容的 API 变更&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; MINOR[&quot;4 - 次版本&lt;br/&gt;向下兼容的新功能&quot;]&#10;    V --&gt; PATCH[&quot;1 - 补丁版本&lt;br/&gt;向下兼容的问题修复&quot;]\">graph LR\n    V[\"2.4.1\"]\n    V --&gt; MAJOR[\"2 - 主版本&lt;br/&gt;不兼容的 API 变更\"]\n    V --&gt; MINOR[\"4 - 次版本&lt;br/&gt;向下兼容的新功能\"]\n    V --&gt; PATCH[\"1 - 补丁版本&lt;br/&gt;向下兼容的问题修复\"]</pre><h3 id=\"版本变更规则\">版本变更规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>版本号变化</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>修复 bug（不改 API）</td>\n<td>PATCH +1</td>\n<td>1.2.3 → 1.2.4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>新增功能（向下兼容）</td>\n<td>MINOR +1</td>\n<td>1.2.3 → 1.3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>破坏性变更</td>\n<td>MAJOR +1</td>\n<td>1.2.3 → 2.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"预发布版本\">预发布版本</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const prereleaseVersions = {&#10;  &#39;1.0.0-alpha.1&#39;: &#39;内部测试版本&#39;,&#10;  &#39;1.0.0-beta.1&#39;: &#39;公开测试版本&#39;,&#10;  &#39;1.0.0-rc.1&#39;: &#39;发布候选版本&#39;,&#10;  &#39;1.0.0&#39;: &#39;正式发布版本&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prereleaseVersions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '1.0.0-alpha.1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'内部测试版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '1.0.0-beta.1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'公开测试版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '1.0.0-rc.1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'发布候选版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '1.0.0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'正式发布版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>预发布版本的排序规则：<code>alpha &lt; beta &lt; rc &lt; release</code></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;1.0.0-alpha.1&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1.0.0-alpha.2&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;1.0.0-beta.1&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;1.0.0-rc.1&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;1.0.0&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"1.0.0-alpha.1\"] --&gt; B[\"1.0.0-alpha.2\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"1.0.0-beta.1\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"1.0.0-rc.1\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"1.0.0\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本范围语法\">版本范围语法</h2><p>npm 使用版本范围（Version Range）来声明依赖的可接受版本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>^1.2.3</td>\n<td>兼容 1.x.x（允许 minor 和 patch）</td>\n<td>&gt;=1.2.3 &lt;2.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>~1.2.3</td>\n<td>近似 1.2.x（只允许 patch）</td>\n<td>&gt;=1.2.3 &lt;1.3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.2.3</td>\n<td>精确版本</td>\n<td>只有 1.2.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;=1.2.3</td>\n<td>大于等于</td>\n<td>&gt;=1.2.3</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.2.x</td>\n<td>通配 patch</td>\n<td>&gt;=1.2.0 &lt;1.3.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>*</td>\n<td>任意版本</td>\n<td>&gt;=0.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"脱字符-的特殊行为\">^（脱字符）的特殊行为</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const caretBehavior = {&#10;  &#39;^1.2.3&#39;: &#39;&gt;=1.2.3 &lt;2.0.0   (标准行为)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;^0.2.3&#39;: &#39;&gt;=0.2.3 &lt;0.3.0   (0.x 版本 minor 视为 breaking)&#39;,&#10;  &#39;^0.0.3&#39;: &#39;&gt;=0.0.3 &lt;0.0.4   (0.0.x 版本 patch 视为 breaking)&#39;,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> caretBehavior</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '^1.2.3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=1.2.3 &#x3C;2.0.0   (标准行为)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '^0.2.3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=0.2.3 &#x3C;0.3.0   (0.x 版本 minor 视为 breaking)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '^0.0.3'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'>=0.0.3 &#x3C;0.0.4   (0.0.x 版本 patch 视为 breaking)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对于 0.x 版本，<code>^</code> 的行为更保守——这反映了 SemVer 规范中 0.x 版本 &quot;API 不稳定&quot; 的语义。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-version-命令\">npm version 命令</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm version patch&#10;npm version minor&#10;npm version major&#10;npm version 2.0.0-beta.1&#10;npm version prerelease --preid=beta\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> major</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 2.0.0-beta.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> version</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prerelease</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --preid=beta</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>npm version</code> 会自动：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>更新 package.json 中的 version 字段</li>\n<li>创建 Git commit</li>\n<li>创建 Git tag</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;scripts&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;preversion&quot;: &quot;npm run lint &amp;&amp; npm run test&quot;,&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;npm run build&quot;,&#10;    &quot;postversion&quot;: &quot;git push &amp;&amp; git push --tags&quot;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scripts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"preversion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npm run lint &#x26;&#x26; npm run test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npm run build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"postversion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"git push &#x26;&#x26; git push --tags\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"npm-publish-流程\">npm publish 流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[准备发布] --&gt; CHECK[检查清单]&#10;    CHECK --&gt; BUILD[运行 prepublishOnly&lt;br/&gt;构建和测试]&#10;    BUILD --&gt; PACK[npm pack 预览]&#10;    PACK --&gt; REVIEW{检查包内容}&#10;    REVIEW --&gt;|满意| PUBLISH[npm publish]&#10;    REVIEW --&gt;|需调整| FIX[修改 files 字段&lt;br/&gt;或 .npmignore]&#10;    FIX --&gt; PACK&#10;    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[npm dist-tag]&#10;    TAG --&gt; DONE[发布完成]\">flowchart TD\n    START[准备发布] --&gt; CHECK[检查清单]\n    CHECK --&gt; BUILD[运行 prepublishOnly&lt;br/&gt;构建和测试]\n    BUILD --&gt; PACK[npm pack 预览]\n    PACK --&gt; REVIEW{检查包内容}\n    REVIEW --&gt;|满意| PUBLISH[npm publish]\n    REVIEW --&gt;|需调整| FIX[修改 files 字段&lt;br/&gt;或 .npmignore]\n    FIX --&gt; PACK\n    PUBLISH --&gt; TAG[npm dist-tag]\n    TAG --&gt; DONE[发布完成]</pre><h3 id=\"发布前检查\">发布前检查</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm pack --dry-run&#10;&#10;npm pack&#10;tar -tzf my-package-1.0.0.tgz&#10;&#10;npm publish --dry-run\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pack</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">tar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -tzf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package-1.0.0.tgz</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>npm pack</code> 会生成与发布到 Registry 完全相同的 tarball，便于在发布前检查包含了哪些文件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"dist-tag-管理\">dist-tag 管理</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm publish&#10;&#10;npm publish --tag beta&#10;&#10;npm publish --tag next&#10;&#10;npm dist-tag add my-package@2.0.0-beta.1 beta&#10;&#10;npm dist-tag ls my-package&#10;&#10;npm install my-package@beta\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> beta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> publish</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> next</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist-tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package@2.0.0-beta.1</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> beta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dist-tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ls</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package@beta</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>dist-tag</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>latest</td>\n<td>默认稳定版本</td>\n<td>npm install pkg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>beta</td>\n<td>测试版本</td>\n<td>npm install pkg@beta</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>next</td>\n<td>下一个大版本预览</td>\n<td>npm install pkg@next</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>canary</td>\n<td>每次 commit 自动发布的版本</td>\n<td>npm install pkg@canary</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"changesets-工具链\">Changesets 工具链</h2><p>Changesets 是一个专门为 monorepo 设计的版本管理和发布工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pnpm add -Dw @changesets/cli&#10;pnpm changeset init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -Dw</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @changesets/cli</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pnpm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> changeset</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    DEV[开发者完成功能] --&gt; CS[pnpm changeset]&#10;    CS --&gt; SELECT[选择影响的包]&#10;    SELECT --&gt; BUMP[选择版本变更类型&lt;br/&gt;patch/minor/major]&#10;    BUMP --&gt; WRITE[编写变更描述]&#10;    WRITE --&gt; FILE[生成 .changeset/*.md]&#10;    FILE --&gt; PR[提交 PR]&#10;    PR --&gt; MERGE[合并到主分支]&#10;    MERGE --&gt; VERSION[pnpm changeset version]&#10;    VERSION --&gt; UPDATE[更新 package.json 版本&lt;br/&gt;生成 CHANGELOG.md]&#10;    UPDATE --&gt; PUBLISH[pnpm changeset publish]\">flowchart TD\n    DEV[开发者完成功能] --&gt; CS[pnpm changeset]\n    CS --&gt; SELECT[选择影响的包]\n    SELECT --&gt; BUMP[选择版本变更类型&lt;br/&gt;patch/minor/major]\n    BUMP --&gt; WRITE[编写变更描述]\n    WRITE --&gt; FILE[生成 .changeset/*.md]\n    FILE --&gt; PR[提交 PR]\n    PR --&gt; MERGE[合并到主分支]\n    MERGE --&gt; VERSION[pnpm changeset version]\n    VERSION --&gt; UPDATE[更新 package.json 版本&lt;br/&gt;生成 CHANGELOG.md]\n    UPDATE --&gt; PUBLISH[pnpm changeset publish]</pre><h3 id=\"changeset-文件示例\">Changeset 文件示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"---&#10;&#39;@myorg/core&#39;: minor&#10;&#39;@myorg/utils&#39;: patch&#10;---&#10;&#10;新增 `formatCurrency` 工具函数，支持多种货币格式化。修复了 `parseDate` 在处理闰年时的边界错误。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/core'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">minor</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'@myorg/utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">patch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">---</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">新增 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`formatCurrency`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 工具函数，支持多种货币格式化。修复了 </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`parseDate`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 在处理闰年时的边界错误。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自动化-ci-cd-发布\">自动化 CI/CD 发布</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"name: Release&#10;on:&#10;  push:&#10;    branches: [main]&#10;&#10;jobs:&#10;  release:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;      - uses: pnpm/action-setup@v2&#10;      - uses: actions/setup-node@v4&#10;        with:&#10;          node-version: 20&#10;          cache: pnpm&#10;&#10;      - run: pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;      - run: pnpm run build&#10;      - run: pnpm run test&#10;&#10;      - name: Create Release PR or Publish&#10;        uses: changesets/action@v1&#10;        with:&#10;          publish: pnpm changeset publish&#10;          version: pnpm changeset version&#10;        env:&#10;          GITHUB_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}&#10;          NPM_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Release</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    branches</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">main</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  release</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm/action-setup@v2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/setup-node@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          node-version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cache</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm run test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Create Release PR or Publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">changesets/action@v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          publish</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset publish</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pnpm changeset version</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        env</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.GITHUB_TOKEN }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          NPM_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${{ secrets.NPM_TOKEN }}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Changeset GitHub Action 会自动创建一个&quot;Version Packages&quot;的 PR，收集所有待发布的变更。当 PR 被合并时，自动执行发布。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"废弃与撤回\">废弃与撤回</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"npm deprecate my-package@1.0.0 &quot;此版本存在安全漏洞，请升级到 1.0.1&quot;&#10;&#10;npm deprecate my-package@&quot;&lt;2.0.0&quot; &quot;1.x 版本已停止维护&quot;&#10;&#10;npm unpublish my-package@1.0.0-beta.1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deprecate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package@1.0.0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"此版本存在安全漏洞，请升级到 1.0.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deprecate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package@\"&#x3C;2.0.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"1.x 版本已停止维护\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">npm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> unpublish</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my-package@1.0.0-beta.1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关于 <code>npm unpublish</code> 的规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>发布 72 小时内可以撤回</li>\n<li>72 小时后只能使用 deprecate</li>\n<li>被其他包依赖的版本不能撤回</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"发布检查清单\">发布检查清单</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const publishChecklist: Record&lt;string, boolean&gt; = {&#10;  &#39;package.json version 已更新&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;CHANGELOG 已更新&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;构建产物已生成（npm run build）&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;所有测试通过（npm test）&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;类型检查通过（tsc --noEmit）&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;npm pack --dry-run 检查文件列表&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;README 更新了最新的 API 文档&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;LICENSE 文件存在&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;exports 字段配置正确&#39;: false,&#10;  &#39;engines 声明了最低 Node.js 版本&#39;: false,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> publishChecklist</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'package.json version 已更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'CHANGELOG 已更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '构建产物已生成（npm run build）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '所有测试通过（npm test）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '类型检查通过（tsc --noEmit）'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'npm pack --dry-run 检查文件列表'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'README 更新了最新的 API 文档'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'LICENSE 文件存在'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'exports 字段配置正确'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'engines 声明了最低 Node.js 版本'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SemVer（MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH）是 npm 生态的版本管理标准。</li>\n<li><code>^</code> 允许 minor 和 patch 更新，<code>~</code> 只允许 patch 更新，0.x 版本有特殊行为。</li>\n<li><code>npm version</code> 自动更新版本、创建 commit 和 tag。</li>\n<li><code>npm pack</code> 和 <code>--dry-run</code> 是发布前必做的检查步骤。</li>\n<li>dist-tag 管理多发布通道（latest、beta、next、canary）。</li>\n<li>Changesets 是 monorepo 版本管理和自动化发布的最佳工具。</li>\n<li>发布后 72 小时内可以 unpublish，之后只能 deprecate。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"版本管理与发布","id":"版本管理与发布"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"语义化版本（SemVer）","id":"语义化版本-semver"},{"level":3,"text":"版本变更规则","id":"版本变更规则"},{"level":3,"text":"预发布版本","id":"预发布版本"},{"level":2,"text":"版本范围语法","id":"版本范围语法"},{"level":3,"text":"^（脱字符）的特殊行为","id":"脱字符-的特殊行为"},{"level":2,"text":"npm version 命令","id":"npm-version-命令"},{"level":2,"text":"npm publish 流程","id":"npm-publish-流程"},{"level":3,"text":"发布前检查","id":"发布前检查"},{"level":3,"text":"dist-tag 管理","id":"dist-tag-管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Changesets 工具链","id":"changesets-工具链"},{"level":3,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":3,"text":"Changeset 文件示例","id":"changeset-文件示例"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化 CI/CD 发布","id":"自动化-ci-cd-发布"},{"level":2,"text":"废弃与撤回","id":"废弃与撤回"},{"level":2,"text":"发布检查清单","id":"发布检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"pnpm 与 Monorepo","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/package-management/pnpm-and-monorepos"},"next":{"title":"fs、path 与 os","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nodejs-and-npm/core-apis/fs-path-and-os"}}